### 1. Authenticate as Admin (Acquires Auth Token Vector)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@booking.local",
  "password": "admin123"
}

> {% client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.token); %}

### 2. Authenticate as Standard User
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@booking.local",
  "password": "user123"
}

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.body.token); %}

### 3. Create a New Bookable Resource (Requires Admin Token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/resources
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "name": "Conference Room A",
  "type": "ROOM",
  "pricePerHour": 75.50,
  "available": true
}

### 4. Fetch All Resources (Public Access Path - No Token Needed)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/resources
Accept: application/json

### 5. Create a New Reservation (Requires User Token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

{
  "resourceId": 1,
  "startTime": "2026-10-15T09:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-10-15T12:00:00"
}